{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04952","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 马怀素","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"季月啓重阳，金舆陟宝坊。\n御旗横日道，仙塔俨云庄。\n帝跸千官从，乾词七曜光。\n顾慙文墨职，无以颂时康。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马怀素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}